# LEGACY-ASAHI(2027-02-28): the mkinitcpio hook was renamed to "aurora". An
# mkinitcpio.conf written before the rename still lists the old name; this
# alias builds the same hook so that initramfs keeps loading vendor firmware.
# add_runscript names the runtime hook after the file that defines build(), so
# the image gets /hooks/aurora either way.
. /usr/lib/initcpio/install/aurora
